{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16014","headline":"秋夜曲二首 一 · 王建","name":"秋夜曲二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天清漏长霜泊泊，兰绿收荣桂膏涸。\n高楼云鬟弄婵娟，古瑟暗断秋风弦。\n玉关遥隔万里道，金刀不翦双泪泉。\n香囊火死香气少，向帷合眼何时晓。\n城乌作营啼野月，秦州少妇生离别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}